{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the following binomial coefficient equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d827ff0e18b271f45e0e7f6eb55d4bc1edd127.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16 \\binom{m}{k} + 3\\binom{n}{k+1}=48z\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"53\" />\nfor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/0/a7089e0ef5c753553634923a3c4c569e75788405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,k,n,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" /> are positive integers. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is minimized, find the smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rewrite the equation as:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced0fccb198cf9973f80bff0893b09eec8e6f2a9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{16m!}{k!(m-k)!}+\\frac{3n!}{(k+1)!(n-k-1)!}=48z\\]\" width=\"316\" height=\"42\" />\nThis implies that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8dac5ead4dd4be4c012b603062d8c1b498896bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\mid\\frac{m!}{k!(m-k)!}, \\quad 16\\mid\\frac{n!}{(k+1)!(n-k-1)!}\\]\" width=\"324\" height=\"42\" />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/a/dba32375f12c078f958298795d08544d9364cb12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m!}{k!(m-k)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"85\" height=\"42\" /> to be divisble by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb9d913109f09f79aa0f9b8182f420dd409b69ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m!$\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> must have at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and has more factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ffdb5b35c742c42d24bca4c0f8d5c800f61ad92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k!$\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daa25ae8d0385f77160733427d00e7bb0f130fae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-k)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> (so it does not get cancelled out). Then, the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a64b116200d1f7f04e1bc9f6e03fa0d8af748fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\ge k\\ge1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, we have to test for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/064ef04cf06a910513d8b3d9b4a55248aee8759a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\in\\{1,2,3\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Notice that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/3359f43f0fd0ed3b672d389374aecd0360921a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ffdb5b35c742c42d24bca4c0f8d5c800f61ad92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k!$\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/7/59763e9d458f9cbc0a1ccf7a8ea69545581d5eff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-k)!=(3-k)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" /> would lead to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb9d913109f09f79aa0f9b8182f420dd409b69ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m!$\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> being cancelled out, leading to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So, the only valid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> that works is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/f/34ffc1e5d1b29241dc2ffb3fe76d44d99f5f6b0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\in\\{1,2\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>And similarly, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/d/64d383b7fb1317d826e384d095e839a6caae40d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n!}{(k+1)!(n-k-1)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"44\" /> to be divisible by 16, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must have atleast <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and has more factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/9/8797c058bfca71de29a28b1ecf2d60726996aacb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(k+1)!,(n-k-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" /> (combined). Since we want to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we choose the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> as well. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f681bd84648c174d45eed0037702cae77ed0686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef5bb46543ce3bc84e949fa23891b923aed94ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n!}{(3)!(n-3)!}=\\frac{n(n-1)(n-2)}{6}\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c874a6ca8456dd226bf716c2edfdd97d1bfd7665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> is the minimal value we can choose, as lower <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> will have less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factors of 2 after cancelling:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a17a2cce7ec7f7fbe62a85073c16fa5266bcb41e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{16!}{(3)!(13)!}=\\frac{16\\cdot15\\cdot14}{6}=16\\cdot35\\]\" width=\"250\" height=\"42\" />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed8470bc717a49aafe4556c7e2c2e11ddc7b687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/0/2f04c7995d10692b0d9498c24c7bc6a0c53b9417.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n!}{2!(n-2)!}=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}\\]\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\" />\nSimilarly, we can choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/3025565ffe4718f62b4e119b2cf941149b5ffd33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=32$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> (as choosing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c874a6ca8456dd226bf716c2edfdd97d1bfd7665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> would result it being cancelled into 8, and any lower <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> will not have sufficient enough amount of factors):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/376f6b50068ca87d3212af5dccaf7c6a93d81ca6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{32!}{2!(32-2)!}=\\frac{32(31)}{2}=16\\cdot31\\]\" width=\"236\" height=\"43\" />\nSo, it is minimized when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed8470bc717a49aafe4556c7e2c2e11ddc7b687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />. Now, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5ed8470bc717a49aafe4556c7e2c2e11ddc7b687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/3025565ffe4718f62b4e119b2cf941149b5ffd33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=32$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/4/904f27995d33e0d39f43ec959e7cb100516e9396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> into our original equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/6/e0609a42c3685542eb12165e2992e4b649473936.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{16\\cdot3!}{1!(3-1)!}+\\frac{3\\cdot32!}{(1+1)!(32-1-1)!}=48z\\]\" width=\"312\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/1/661ae57b86cba548e6b79283d1588fbda05d480e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16\\cdot3+3\\cdot16\\cdot31=48z \\implies 48z=16\\cdot3(1+31) \\implies \\boxed{z=32}\\]\" width=\"502\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_District_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034946\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 234/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2040/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8935/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.822      1 Template:Indonesia_District_MO_box\n100.00%    7.822      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37858:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034946 and revision id 292515. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}